 India Driving Dataset. We use pixel accuracy and Intersection-Over-Union as the evaluation metrics and experiment different kinds of methods, including weighted loss, data augmentation, transfer learning, and U-Net architecture. Weighted loss method achieved 61.07% average IoU and data augmentation method with rotated and cropped images achieved 63.73% IoU. However, it largely increases the training time. Using the transfer learning VGG, we achieve 73.74% average pixel accuracy and 58.45% average IoU on the test set. In addition, we achieve 78.03% average test pixel accuracy and 64.04% average test IoU by the method of U-Net. Finally, we build a new model named Mobile-Deeplabv3+, and we achieved 83.56% average pixel accuracy and 71.35% average IoU on the test set.","topics":[],"score":286975,"global_rank":29781,"on_pypi":false,"top_pypi":false,"python_rank":6365},{"name":"nkanak/detection-of-fake-news-campaigns","owner":"nkanak","html_url":"https://github.com/nkanak/detection-of-fake-news-campaigns","stars":2,"forks":2,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Python","description":null,"topics":[],"score":286965,"global_rank":29783,"on_pypi":false,"top_pypi":false,"python_rank":6366},{"name":"vishsangale/plum","owner":"vishsangale","html_url":"https://github.com/vishsangale/plum","stars":2,"forks":0,"watchers":0,"issues":0,"language":"Python","description":"implement PLUM (Pre-trained Language Models for Industrial-scale Generative Recommendations) paper","topics":[],"score":286951,"global_rank":29786,"on_pypi":false,"top_pypi":false,"python_rank":6367},{"name":"TheAlexGrimes30/rag-labor-raw","owner":"TheAlexGrimes30","html_url":"https://github.com/TheAlexGrimes30/rag-labor-raw","stars":1,"forks":0,"watchers":0,"issues":1,"language":"Python","description":null,"topics":[],"score":286950,"global_rank":29789,"on_pypi":false,"top_pypi":false,"python_rank":6368},{"name":"vlandeiro/yamlett","owner":"vlandeiro","html_url":"https://github.com/vlandeiro/yamlett","stars":1,"fork